          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Let $W$ be the set of all polynomials in the variable $x\\in R$ with coefficients in $R$ of degree $5$ or greater. Complete the following sentence:\n\n*$W$ is **not** a vector space (with respect to polynomials addition and multiplication of a polynomial by a real number) because $\\text{_________}\\,.$*",
